  "releaseNotes": "v1.11.1 - Ordinary hyperlink clicks. TuiApplication.HyperlinkActivated provides opt-in activation from the rendered frame on an unmodified left click, including terminals without OSC 8. Activation occurs on release; drags, modified clicks, stale targets, and modal interactions do not open links. The example tour opens URLs and files with the operating system default association, fixing inert ordinary clicks on the URI hyperlinks page on macOS. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
